WEBVTT

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:30.096
VM: When we are lonely,

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:33.186
we are actually
in a physiological stress state.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:36.286
And when we're lonely
for a prolonged period of time,

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.581
that translates to a chronic stress state,

00:03:38.605 --> 00:03:41.689
which leads to higher levels
of inflammation in the body,

00:03:41.713 --> 00:03:44.738
which, in turn, damage
blood vessels and tissues

00:03:44.762 --> 00:03:46.646
and lead to a whole host of illnesses

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.856
down the line.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:52.952
AG: In 2014, Vivek Murthy was appointed
US Surgeon General by President Obama.

00:03:52.976 --> 00:03:56.571
He spent a lot of time on all the things
that keep Americans unwell --

00:03:56.595 --> 00:03:59.636
smoking, obesity, opioids --

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:02.488
but he never forgot that profound
experience of loneliness